sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CSMS->>CS: UpdateFirmwareRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: UpdateFirmwareResponse (status = InvalidCertificate)
    CS->>CSMS: SecurityEventNotificationRequest (type = InvalidFirmwareSigningCertificate)
    CSMS-->>CS: SecurityEventNotificationResponse
